### Get all locations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations

### Get all locations with limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations?limit=10

### Get specific location by ID (replace LOCATION_ID with actual location ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/57000000

### Get clan rankings for a location
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/57000000/clanrankings

### Get player rankings for a location
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/57000000/playerrankings

### Get clan war rankings for a location
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/57000000/clanwarrankings

### Get rankings with limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/locations/57000001/playerrankings?limit=20
